  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>DFT-load_sta_laboratory_hospital3
Hospital 3 lab results: laboratorio_hospital3.csv -&gt; sta.sta_laboratory_hospital3, every column as text.
Adds _src_site (hospital code), _src_filename and _src_rownum (where each row came from).
Run by WF-load_sta, which empties sta.sta_laboratory_hospital3 first.
Rows the database refuses (red hop) go to adm.sta_load_reject.</note>
      <xloc>32</xloc>
      <yloc>16</yloc>
      <width>752</width>
      <heigth>110</heigth>
